  "title": "Buenos Aires Strengthens Natural Resources to Protect Low-Income Communities",
  "summary": "This C40 case study describes “Buenos Aires Strengthens Natural Resources to Protect Low-Income Communities,” an urban initiative documented for Buenos Aires. It is included because it addresses river flood hazards, and it has evidence relevant to children's livelihoods, and it is located in the Global South. C40 describes the action this way: In the context of Buenos Aires Hydrolic Master Plan, Lake Soldati has been cleaned and its ecosystem restored, protecting the low-lying communities…",
